{"resourceIdentifier":"4448","resourceName":"Raízes do Bem Grouped ARR Project","description":"The Raízes do Bem Grouped ARR Project aims to implement the reforestation with multifunctional forests in degraded lands and ecological restoration using species with timber potential and native species in the Cerrado and Amazon biomes located in the States of Mato Grosso do Sul and Mato Grosso, in Brazil.\r\n\r\nThe project area will remove GHG through the photosynthesis, a natural process of plants. Thus, the plants will gradually provide the ecosystem service of removing atmospheric carbon dioxide (CO2) and storing carbon in the biomass. The First Instance is expected to generate around 28,408.86 tCO2e during the 60 years crediting period (15-October-2020 to 14-October-2080), with an annual average of 473.48 tCO2e/year.","location":{"latitude":-19.074601,"longitude":-53.808633},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-12-27","endExclusive":"2024-01-27","endInclusive":"2024-01-26"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4448"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mato Grosso and Mato Grosso do Sul"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"BRCARBON SERVICOS AMBIENTAIS LTDA"},{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo, Brazil"},{"type":"string","value":"+55 19 34243583"},{"type":"string","value":"diretoria@brcarbon.com.br"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"204"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-AMS0007"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string"